Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Gathering 100 coins out here\Nwould be an exceedingly difficult task.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we've had the realization\Nthat we can search for the fallen ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and we've already figured out its location.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We are weak. But they\Ncannot take our wits from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This game exposes people for the fools they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Betraying one another. Murdering one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The people here are so determined\Nto see their base desires realized
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,that they transform themselves into monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But we are not fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.95,0:00:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And we will not live like vile monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.79,0:00:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever power may\Nbecome ours, we are humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.25,0:01:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and we are here to end this meaningless game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like someone\Nwas fighting here recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And they didn't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.87,0:02:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:03:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it... They're hiding something!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this marking off turf?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's another team on the other side, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.83,0:03:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, that guy did mention that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.41,0:03:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When we fought Sanbe,\Nwe stumbled into someone's turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be why he showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.87,0:03:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this was put here as a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you pass this mark, you'll be attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.91,0:03:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But the fallen ship is\Non the other side of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can reach it, we'll gain\Na huge advantage over this team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.41,0:03:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,\Nus continuing straight on is bad for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.29,0:03:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't have put this up here\Nif they didn't think they could win fights!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would we go at them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.37,0:04:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you all touchy for?\NIs something bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.25,0:04:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him a break, Clair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.83,0:04:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Ikeuchi, show them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.33,0:04:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikeuchi scouted out some\Nof the dangerous territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.45,0:04:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Their turf spreads out west of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you went in that deep all alone, huh?\NI'm surprised you made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like there are a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, okay. These guys, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You said your sister's name was... Elena?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they were the ones that fought here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We are only after the coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to avoid pointless fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll make the trip longer,\Nbut we'll go around this mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. I'm sure any group that uses\Na symbol like this is full of creeps, anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikeuchi, watch our perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to be relying\Non your abilities from here on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.08,0:05:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'll be on the lookout for scents, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Psh. Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.00,0:05:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We've still got a lot of ground to cover.\NDon't push it too hard, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.37,0:06:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.25,0:06:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! I didn't know you could do that too, Isao!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.12,0:06:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish they were chilled, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on your third already? You eat so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:06:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to get cleavage shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what you will, she's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought her here, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.29,0:07:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to take a break, huh?\NWant one, Ikeuchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.37,0:07:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a job to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.12,0:07:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to need you up ahead, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to get worn out\Nif you're on alert the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.41,0:07:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I can take some.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pretty laid back.\NNothing has even happened yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're eating the watermelon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need the calories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.29,0:07:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Still... Stuff like this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a team now, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.45,0:07:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to tell everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them someone has\Nalready gathered 100 coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,--Umm--\N--We should get back on the trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's safe up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you don't trust me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you just can't be too cautious up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.25,0:08:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This route is dangerous. Let's turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? The map says we're on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything in my lens!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.41,0:08:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We found another team's mark back there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! That's why we're going\Naround their turf now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.83,0:09:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The turf is the problem.\NWhat is the reason to claim turf out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's to keep coins from being\Npicked up by other gatherers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't you think that's weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.91,0:09:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That mark was in front of a\Nsteep slope covered in dark forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.45,0:09:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's not that far from this open riverbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Which place is better for finding coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be easy to see coins here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.87,0:09:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's just as easy to see us\Nand our surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.41,0:09:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What if that mark isn't for claiming turf...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.83,0:09:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the mark... is actually there\Nso that weaker gatherers avoid it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and get herded into this area?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If it is a trap...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We might not be the only ones with wits up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We do have some distance between us, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:10:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They have numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, we're fine. We might be weak,\Nbut we're good at getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're running away. Did they spot us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Six, seven, eight. We've got numbers on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We might lose a couple on our side, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys really are idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's okay to let\Nyour friends die like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need to capture one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.95,0:10:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture one, and treat 'em real nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.00,0:10:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, the others will gradually\Nfall in line and help us gather coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Little speed demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.95,0:10:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he catch us so quickly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.45,0:11:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaahaa! Did my speed scare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Most revolting,\Nyou're a very convincing monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.29,0:11:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, pretty boy. Don't think\NI'll play nice just cause of your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My speed isn't the only\Nimpressive thing about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to stop us here,\Nso his friends can catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, we might as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.83,0:12:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not get too excited, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not trying to take over the world\Nor destroy the human race, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.75,0:13:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do once you've\Ngathered the coins, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer is so simple,\Neven a kid could tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same for everyone, right?\NYou do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.83,0:13:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you yourself are happy,\Nthat's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over your coins, and join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say no, you're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.41,0:13:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a bad deal, right?\NLet's all have some fun together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all a bunch of monsters, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.20,0:14:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, maybe this will\Nmake you want to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take it out of the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing is the real deal, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a girl that wandered\Ninto our turf, just like you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.75,0:14:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She refused to join us, and our boss killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Our boss is tough as hell.\NHe's on a totally different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That worked pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.12,0:14:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It was gross carrying it around,\Nbut I'm glad I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She was beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.20,0:15:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My type.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she do something to you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter. I told you:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters is that\Nyou yourself are having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't really like fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.87,0:15:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to drop out of high school\Nbecause of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I hit someone to protect my friend,\Nand that guy got injured badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.41,0:15:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That was with my normal human strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If I think about what'd happen now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If I unloaded on someone, as a monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.41,0:16:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No... I was wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't as intimidating as\Nother gatherers, so I didn't notice...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can tell now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is... a beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.87,0:16:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's okay if I unload on you, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on! If you touch me, I'll--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.87,0:16:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.62,0:16:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:17:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I couldn't hear\Nwhat you said. Say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it, you piece of shit! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Yota.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I lost my cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No way... He didn't kill him, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems like he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But honestly, I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.95,0:17:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we'd get into\Nsituations like this up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.50,0:17:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but I never thought someone would\Nbe low enough to use a corpse as a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they think anything is\Njustified in achieving their goals?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.83,0:17:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we have other things to worry about!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.79,0:17:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made it clear we're\Nnot on his side, now what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not really a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.29,0:17:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, the fallen ship is up ahead--\Nwe just need to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.50,0:18:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right. Let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.12,0:18:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost them. And I don't see their tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.95,0:18:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanakawa, can you see them\Nwith your x-ray vision?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They're 500 meters straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.79,0:18:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see them, naked bodies and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is messed up. His jaw is knocked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.37,0:18:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't even eat like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.75,0:18:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He was always ugly, but at\Nthis point you just have to laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do, Madoka?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you do? He got all excited\Nand ran off by himself like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's no use anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's useless, why don't you kill him?\NI've always hated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too. He's a creep,\Nand he's always acting like an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys really are shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone can mess up!\NYou're all idiots, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As you all know, I'm your boss--\NI get the coins and the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why I have to show you proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Proof that I'm meant to be the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.16,0:19:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that, Morita?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.87,0:19:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.79,0:19:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...is my pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never abandon you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.37,0:19:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're all a bunch\Nof worthless pieces of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.66,0:20:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You wait here, Morita.\NWe'll give them smiles just like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's like a barricade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a very handy skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.45,0:20:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have to worry\Nabout them catching up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.37,0:20:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh heh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep moving. Clair, are you sure\Nyou don't want to get inside Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot in there. After a while,\NI need to get out and--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.20,0:21:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.91,0:21:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who did that to my little Morita!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.50,0:21:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.62,0:21:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell...? Who is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.75,0:21:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... Don't ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.25,0:21:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Yota!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.41,0:21:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.91,0:22:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.29,0:23:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Episode 10: Beautiful Flower"
